     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Levodopa-induced hallucinations or delirium: quetiapine, pimavanserin or clozapine, which unlike other antipsychotics don't aggravate parkinsonism"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
